OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant drops licence transfer
OL,4,Aafter objections
OL,5,
OL,6,FA restaurant in York caught using
OL,7,Fillegal workers has dropped its bid to
OL,8,Fchange how it is run following
OL,9,Fobjections from the Home Office and
OL,10,FNorth Yorkshire Police.
OL,12,FSky Blue, in Barbican Road, had its
OL,13,Flicence revoked in September following
OL,14,Fraids by the Home Office's Immigration
OL,15,FCompliance and Enforcement officers in
OL,16,FJuly and December 2025.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
