OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant drops licence transfer
OL,4,Aafter objections
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt had applied to transfer its premises
OL,7,Flicences to Yuk Chuan Pang, however
OL,8,Fpolice stated she had a business
OL,9,Frelationship with the previous licence
OL,10,Fholder who had been present during
OL,11,Fimmigration raids.
OL,13,FThe restaurant dropped the request
OL,14,Fahead of a hearing on 29 October.
